    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community borders Harwood Avenue to the southwest and Newtown Road, Shaker Lane, and Power Road to the southeast.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littleton_Common%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Massachusetts Route 2A and Route 110 (King Street) head west from Littleton Common, reaching Ayer in seven miles.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littleton_Common%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Long Pond lies in the southern part of Littleton Common, offering a local waterway.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
