      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littleton_Common%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Beaver Brook runs northward along the western edge, feeding the Merrimack River watershed.",
